                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Butler to Mr. Gresham.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-02-14"><hi rendition="#italic">February 14,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister Gray died at 7 o’clock this evening.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Butler.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
